  "coverage_disclaimer": {
    "zh": "本平台分省年度统计数据来源于国家统计局，覆盖中国大陆31个省、自治区、直辖市。香港特别行政区、澳门特别行政区和台湾地区采用独立统计制度，国家统计局分省年度汇总数据不包含上述地区。数据缺失仅反映统计口径覆盖范围，不构成任何地理归属判断。",
    "en": "Provincial annual statistics on this platform are sourced from the National Bureau of Statistics of China (NBS) and cover the 31 provincial-level administrative divisions of Mainland China. Hong Kong SAR, Macao SAR, and Taiwan maintain independent statistical systems and are not included in NBS provincial series; missing values reflect statistical coverage only and carry no geographic or territorial judgment."
